  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A pure sample of iodine-131 decays into xenon with a half-life of 8 days.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{number of iodine atoms remaining}}{\\textit{number of xenon atoms formed}}\"></span> after 24 days?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{8}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{7}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{7}{8}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{8}{7}\"></span></li></ol>"
